+### Optional Python lint companion
+
+Ruff remains the required Python lint check. To additionally run
+[`unref`](https://unref.readthedocs.io/en/latest/) for unreferenced Python
+definitions, install it and explicitly enable the companion check:
+
+```bash
+pip install unref
+hammer tasks config set repo.lint_secondary unref
+```
+
+The companion check is disabled by default. When enabled, it runs from the
+current task worktree and blocks validation if `unref` reports findings or is
+not installed. Ruff's `--fix` support is unchanged; `unref` has no autofix.
+
 ## 🎉 Why HAMMER RULES?
 
 - **No external services** - Pure git
